  9	<body>
 10	    <div class="container">
 11	        <h1>Collaborative Filtering Movie Recommender</h1>
 12	        <p>Select a user, and we will recommend movies two ways: by similar users (User-Based CF) and by similar movies (Item-Based CF).</p>
 13	
 14	        <div class="controls">
 15	            <select id="user-select">
 16	                <option value="" disabled selected>Select a user</option>
 17	            </select>
 18	            <button id="recommend-btn" onclick="getRecommendations()">Get Recommendations</button>
